  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Unapologetically bold and fearless low-top silhouette rings in the next generation of Air\nLightweight and airy mesh upper with three-layer textured printing for a game-changing look\nGem-like Swoosh on the upper surrounded by sharp, digital print inspired by the poison dart frog\nPadded tongue and collar with a lace closure for a comfortable, locked-in fit\nContoured, point-loaded Air cushioning for a soft, smooth and stable ride with fluid transitions\nTinted, translucent rubber outsole offers enhanced grip and stability\nThe Nike Air Liquid Max is imported.\nExperience a new evolution of Air with the Big Kids' Nike Air Liquid Max Casual Shoes, a boldly conspicuous lifestyle design that fuses four decades of heritage with cutting-edge innovations to form an aesthetic unlike any other in the storied lineage. A vibrant nanoprint graphic stands out across the progressive upper, laying the groundwork for dynamic colors and eye-catching textures. Engineered with a minimalist, less-is-more approach, the Air Liquid Max features a low-profile, point-loaded Air unit contoured precisely where you need it underfoot. Surrounded by cored-out negative space to eliminate excess weight, this unique geometry delivers a soft, stable, and fluid ride that brings you closer than ever to walking on air.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Big Kids' Nike Air Liquid Max Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Grade School</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Metallic Silver/Light Army</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3379637</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Grade School - Kids')</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike footwear size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 3.5Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 4.0Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 4.5Y</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center